# Abbreviated keywords, mixed case and line continuations, on a damped Duffing oscillator. Duffing (1918); illustrative values.
PAR Om=1.2,Gam=0.3
P delta=0.2 alpha=-1
pzz beta=1
NUMBER eps=0.5
!w2=Om*Om
drag=2delta*Y
Aux Ener=Y^2/2+alpha*X^2/2
dX/Dt=Y
DY/dT=-drag-alpha*X-beta*X^3 \
   +Gam*COS(Om*T)
I X=1,\
  Y=0
@ TOTAL=100,Xp=x,YP=y
Done
